    "goal": "The reader should understand whether higher-priced books achieve better user ratings, how pricing and rating patterns differ between Fiction and Non-Fiction, which authors and price segments dominate the bestseller list, and how these dynamics have evolved from 2009 to 2019 — enabling data-informed decisions for pricing strategy and catalog curation."
