            <div class="insight-box">
                <strong>Key Finding:</strong> Non-Fiction dominates the bestseller list with 56% of entries and commands a 37% price premium ($14.84 vs. $10.85). However, Fiction books generate 73% more reviews on average, suggesting higher reader engagement despite lower pricing.
