        <div class="section">
            <h2 class="section-title"><span class="section-number">2</span>Price vs. User Rating: Correlation Analysis</h2>

            <div class="correlation-box">
                <div class="label">Pearson Correlation Coefficient</div>
                <div class="coefficient">r = -0.133</div>
                <div class="interpretation">Weak negative correlation — higher prices are slightly associated with lower ratings</div>
