            <div class="chart-container">
                <canvas id="scatterChart"></canvas>
            </div>

            <div class="insight-box">
                <strong>Interpretation:</strong> The correlation coefficient of r = -0.133 indicates a <strong>weak negative relationship</strong> between price and user rating. This suggests that in the Amazon bestseller context, paying more does not translate to higher satisfaction. The data shows price has minimal predictive power for rating quality among top-selling books.
