                    <tr><td>$50+</td><td>6 (1%)</td><td>4.68</td></tr>
                </tbody>
            </table>
            <div class="insight-box">
                <strong>Finding:</strong> Books priced under $10 achieve the highest average rating (4.68), while the $10-$20 segment shows the lowest rating (4.56). Premium-priced books ($50+) perform similarly to budget titles.
            </div>
