                <ul style="margin-top: 12px; padding-left: 20px;">
                    <li><strong>2015:</strong> Sharp price decline from $14.64 (2014) to $10.42 — a 29% drop — while ratings improved. Suggests readers accepted lower prices without sacrificing satisfaction.</li>
                    <li><strong>2012:</strong> Peak review volume (13,091 avg) indicates highest customer engagement. Ratings dipped slightly to 4.53 — the lowest in the decade.</li>
                    <li><strong>2019:</strong> Best ratings (4.74) combined with lowest average price ($10.08) — the optimal combination in the dataset.</li>
